msgid ""
"<span hidden=\"hidden\" id=\"unsynced-message\">Unsynchronized changes. The server has not confirmed this content.</span><span hidden=\"hidden\" id=\"saved-message\">Saved on the server.</span><span hidden=\"hidden\" id=\"offline-message\">Connection unavailable. Changes remain unsynchronized. Refresh and compare the server version before retrying.</span><span hidden=\"hidden\" id=\"readonly-message\">Read only. Acquire the independent editor before changing text.</span>\n"
